Dhaka invitees see `08:30Z`). The new \"different timezone\" sub-assertion only verifies that the two invitees see the same UTC slot list; it does not exercise the real production shape where the stored Date represents the organizer's wall clock. With the production shape the PR's formula would emit slots shifted by the full organizer↔invitee offset and the tests would fail, so this gap is hiding the high-severity timezone bug above."}]}
